## Computing |HK|²

Returning to original coordinates: H = (−4800√2, 0), K = (980√2, 980√2).

$$\vec{HK} = (980\sqrt{2} + 4800\sqrt{2},\; 980\sqrt{2}) = (5780\sqrt{2},\; 980\sqrt{2})$$

